---
description: Test and verification requirements
globs: ["tests/**", "scripts/verify_release.py", ".github/workflows/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Add tests for every behavioral change and adversarial tests for integrity boundaries.
- Cover malformed JSON, path traversal, evidence replacement, event truncation or tampering, migration preservation, and package-resource inclusion.
- Maintain the configured coverage gate.
- Keep unit, integration, security, package, and release checks distinct.
- A passing test is technical evidence only and must not be represented as substantive assurance.
